    "identifier": "sakura-twister",
    "description": "<p>You grip your weapon, crouch down and do a slight dash forward, twisting your entire body to execute a devastating slash. Make a melee taijutsu attack, dealing your [Weapons damage] + 10d8 and the target must make a Constitution saving throw, becoming Prone and Staggered on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: On a successful hit, you bounce back, moving into a space of your choice within 20 feet and gain the benefits of the Dodge action.</p>\n<p>Chain 3: This attack is made against all creatures within the weapons range AC, applying its effects on a hit.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above A-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d8.</p>",
